    "title": "Real Flame's Low-Profile Fire Pit Is on Sale for $116 at Wayfair Right Now - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Alexander ,\n51 minutes ago\nMen’s Journal aims to feature only the best products and services. If you buy something via one of our links, we may earn a commission.\nWhy We Love This Deal Wayfair’s Epic Fall Sale is now live with up to 70% off grills , furniture , and more. The sale is packed with great home buys, but many are using it to make their outdoor seating areas more cozy for the incoming fall temperature drop. The best way to do that? A new fire pit like this one from Real Flame that's under $120 while the sale is on.\nThe Real Flame Breton Wood Burning Fire Pit is now just $116, a 55% discount on its normal price of $255, and, crucially, it ships for free. This is the best price online—better than what it's listed for at Target and even directly from the brand itself .\nReal Flame Breton Wood Burning Fire Pit, $116 (was $255) at Wayfair The Real Flame Breton Wood Burning Fire Pit. Courtesy of Wayfair\nWhat Shoppers Should Know Size: The Breton Wood Burning Fire Pit has a 36.75-inch square base and a height of 19.5 inches. Weight: 33 pounds total Material: Steel Accessories Included: Spark screen, fire poker, log grate, cover This Real Flame fire pit is square and sits relatively low to the ground, giving you the chance to sit around it like a campfire. It includes sturdy legs and a steel construction for a long life. Included with this fire pit are a poker, a log grate, a safety spark screen, and a cover for when the pit isn’t in use. In other words, you get pretty much everything but the wood and the fire starter.\nAfter a short screw-together assembly, you’ll have a fire pit ready to entertain for years. Note that, while this fire pit totals 33 pounds, it really isn’t made to be transported. Instead, this is the type of fire pit that you’ll likely locate in your backyard or near your patio and make a fixture for chill fall and early winter nights.\nRelated: This 'Really Comfortable' 4-Piece Patio Set Is on Sale for Less Than $200 at Walmart Right Now\nWhat Shoppers Are Saying One thing that buyers really like about this fire pit is how much it adds to their events. A user from Maryland declared it “great for low-key backyard gatherings,” but we even saw Floridians admitting it added to the ambiance of their backyards.\nThere’s an option to get the fire pit professionally assembled for $115, which may lead you to think that the installation will be difficult. Shoppers, however, disagree. One said that it was “so easy” to assemble and that it only took 15 minutes as a solo job, while another called it “extremely easy to put together.” Skip this option and trust your ability to assemble the fire pit yourself.\nThe Real Flame Breton Wood Burning Fire Pit is just $116 while this sale lasts. Don’t miss it.\nShop More Wayfair Epic Fall Sale Deals",
